  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coalitions for Change Program Phase 3 - Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coalitions for Change Program Phase 3 (CfC3) is a grant to The Asia Foundation that builds on the success of previous phases. CfC3 works with formal and informal networks and coalitions to advocate for transformative policy reforms that improve the lives of Filipinos. The program will closely align with the priorities of Australia and the Philippines indicated in the Development Partnership Plan (2024-2028) and work with a wide range of local stakeholders and organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
